,"family":"fujibayashi-clan","cost":5,"gender":"男性","current_tier":"Tier4","portrait":"assets/portraits/fujibayashimasayasu.webp","stats":[{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","stat":"武勇","level1":71,"growth":1.8,"level50":159.2},{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","stat":"知略","level1":73,"growth":1.43,"level50":143.1},{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","stat":"統率","level1":43,"growth":0.84,"level50":84.2},{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","stat":"速度","level1":56,"growth":1.32,"level50":120.7},{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","stat":"政務","level1":8,"growth":0.1,"level50":12.9},{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","stat":"魅力","level1":59,"growth":0.77,"level50":96.7}],"troops":[],"tags":[{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","tag":"S4新武将","kind":"season"}],"traits":[],"unique_tactic":{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","name":"神出鬼没","category":"能動","effect":"2ターンの間、自身が通常攻撃の対象となる確率が大幅に低下し、次の通常攻撃後、攻撃対象に追加で兵刃ダメージ（149%→298%）を与える。"},"tiers":[{"general_id":"fujibayashimasayasu","season":"S4","tier":"Tier4"}],"source":{"source_url":"https://www.sanguo-zhi.com/wiki/general/fujibayashimasayasu/","title":"藤林正保 S4資料"}},{"id":"uragamimunekage","name":"浦上宗景","kana":"うらがみむねかげ","rarity":5,"faction":"群雄","family":"uragami-clan","cost":4,"gender":"男性","current_tier":"Tier3","portrait":"assets/portraits/uragamimunekage.webp","stats":[{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","stat":"武勇","level1":65,"growth":1.12,"level50":119.9},{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","stat":"知略","level1":70,"growth":1.66,"level50":151.3},{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","stat":"統率","level1":60,"growth":1.02,"level50":110},{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","stat":"速度","level1":38,"growth":0.79,"level50":76.7},{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","stat":"政務","level1":62,"growth":0.77,"level50":99.7},{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","stat":"魅力","level1":64,"growth":0.82,"level50":104.2}],"troops":[],"tags":[{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","tag":"S4新武将","kind":"season"}],"traits":[],"unique_tactic":{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","name":"天神山残照","category":"受動","effect":"4ターン目まで、毎ターン行動前に自身の武勇・知略が1ターン上昇（Lv10基準30→60、知略依存）。上昇量はターンごとに25%ずつ減衰する。通常攻撃後、対象へ追加計略ダメージ（53%→106%、知略依存）。5ターン目に知略が最も高い友軍単体へ1ターン混乱を付与。大将時は5ターン目まで属性上昇が続き、減衰率は20%になる。"},"tiers":[{"general_id":"uragamimunekage","season":"S4","tier":"Tier3"}],"source":{"source_url":"https://www.sanguo-zhi.com/wiki/general/uragamimunekage/","title":"浦上宗景 S4資料"},"commentary":"【運用のポイント】開幕時の上乗せが最も大きい短期決戦型。通常時は毎ターン25％、大将時は20％ずつ上乗せ量が減ります。基礎能力は下がりません。\n\n【混乱に注意】5ターン目には知略が最も高い友軍単体へ1ターン混乱を付与します。通常時は4ターン以内の決着を狙いたい武将です。\n\n【追加計略は継続】属性上昇が終了しても、通常攻撃後の追加計略ダメージは残ります。序盤の大きな上乗せを生かして攻めましょう。","commentary_season":4}],"tactics":[{"id":"s4-rikuriku-doushin","name":"戮力同心","rank":"S","category":"指揮","activation_rate":"100 (指揮)","effect":"戦闘中、毎ターン確率（統率依存）で自身と友軍単体の兵力を回復。自身の兵力が自軍内で最も低くない場合は友軍複数を回復し、回復率が上昇する。","first_season":"S4","applicable_troop":null,"acquisition":"武将伝授 長野業正","general_ids":["naganonarimasa"],"source":{"source_url":"https://www.sanguo-zhi.com/entry/s4-gacha/","title":"S4新戦法資料"}},{"id":"s4-ryuukihei","name":"竜騎兵","rank":"S","category":"兵種","activation_rate":"100 (Lv1) / 100 (Lv10)","effect":"鉄砲が『獅子奮迅の竜騎兵』に進化。部隊行軍速度が5%→50%上昇。毎ターン開始時、弾丸がなければ1発装填し、25%の確率（武勇・速度依存）で2発装填。弾丸がある場合は35%→70%の確率（速度依存）で1発消費し、敵軍単体へ52%→104%の追加ダメージ。ダメージ種別は武勇・知略の高い方に依存。伊達政宗が率いる場合、自軍武将は行動後20%→40%の確率（武勇・知略依存）でさらに1発装填。【伊達政宗との相性】知略を武勇よりわずかに高くすると計略ダメージ回数を補いやすい。ただし、政宗の特性「独眼竜」は両能力の差が小さいほど強く、差を広げると与ダメージ上昇が低下する。知略に偏らせすぎず、武勇とのバランスを保つことが重要。","first_season":"S4","applicable_troop":"鉄砲専用","acquisition":"武将伝授 伊達政宗","general_ids":["datemasamune"],"source":{"source_url":"https://www.sanguo-zhi.com/entry/s4-gacha/","title":"S4新戦法資料"}},{"id":"s4-ifuurinrin","name":"威風凜々","rank":"S","category":"突撃","activation_rate":"35 (Lv1) / 35 (Lv10)","effect":"通常攻撃後、対象へ兵刃ダメージ（119%→238%）を与え、対象が次に与えるダメージを21%→42%低下。効果は対象ごとに最大4回まで重ねがけ可能。","first_season":"S4","applicable_troop":null,"acquisition":"武将伝授 佐竹義重 / 三好実休","general_ids":["satakeyoshishige","miyoshijikkyuu"],"source":{"source_url":"https://www.sanguo-zhi.com/entry/s4-gacha/","title":"S4新戦法資料"}},{"id":"s4-iganinja","name":"伊賀忍者","rank":"S","category":"兵種","activation_rate":"100 (Lv1) / 100 (Lv10)","effect":"弓兵兵種戦法。自軍全体の武勇・速度が5→10増加。密報を利用して通常攻撃後の追加兵刃ダメージを狙い、密報消費後は疲弊を付与する。","first_season":"S4","applicable_troop":"弓兵専用","acquisition":"武将伝授 藤林正保","general_ids":["fujibayashimasayasu"],"source":{"source_url":"https://www.sanguo-zhi.com/entry/s4-gacha/","title":"S4新戦法資料"}}],"patch_tactics":[{"name":"荷駄崩し","first_season":"S4","activation_rate":"40 (Lv1) / 40 (Lv10)","effect":"敵軍複数（2名）に計略ダメージを与え、対象の被回復効果を低下させる。ユーザー提供のS4資料ではダメージ率67%→134%、被回復効果20%→40%低下。","acquisition":"武将伝授 堀直政 / 浦上宗景","general_ids":["horinaomasa","uragamimunekage"]},{"name":"重農主義 じゅうのうしゅぎ","first_season":"S4","activation_rate":"100 (Lv1) / 100 (Lv10)","effect":"評定衆として任命された時、自身の兵糧増産の利点効果が2.5%→5%上昇（政務依存）。","acquisition":"武将伝授 大久保長安","general_ids":["ookubonagayasu"]}],"formations":[{"id":"s4-date-sanada","season":4,"name":"伊達政宗・真田昌幸・三好実休","variant_label":"政宗・昌幸・三好／竜騎兵","tier":"Tier1","tier_provisional":true,"tier_basis":"台湾の主流編成紹介と実戦記事に重複掲載。凸条件を満たす場合の主力候補として暫定Tier1。統計的な順位ではありません。","faction":"混成","troops":"鉄砲","requirement":"対人向け／出典は全員3凸","members":[{"formation_id":"s4-date-sanada","slot":1,"role":"主将","general_id":"datemasamune","general_name":"伊達政宗","attribute_plan":"武勇・知略を均等","equipment":null,"main_school":null,"sub_school":null,"tactics":[{"formation_id":"s4-date-sanada","member_slot":1,"tactic_slot":1,"tactic_id":"datemasamune-ryuukihei","tactic_name":"竜騎兵"},{"formation_id":"s4-date-sanada","member_slot":1,"tactic_slot":2,"tactic_id":"tr032","tactic_name":"攻其不備"}]},{"formation_id":"s4-date-sanada","slot":2,"role":"副将","general_id":"sanadamasayuki","general_name":"真田昌幸","attribute_plan":"知略","equipment":null,"main_school":null,"sub_school":null,"tactics":[{"formation_id":"s4-date-sanada","member_slot":2,"tactic_slot":1,"tactic_id":"tr003","tactic_name":"草木皆兵"},{"formation_id":"s4-date-sanada","member_slot":2,"tactic_slot":2,"tactic_id":"tr067","tactic_name":"深慮遠謀"}]},{"fo